    "title": "Washtenaw County Primary Turnout Climbs Sharply in 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago Chelsea, Dexter and Saline followed the countywide trend, casting more ballots and posting higher turnout despite little growth—or declines—in registered voters. Voter participation increased substantially in Washtenaw County during the Aug. 4, 2026, midterm primary compared with the Aug. 2, 2022, midterm primary, even as the county reported considerably fewer registered voters. Read full article\n3",
